{"tool_name":"matlab-communicator-(icy)","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This plugin provides low-level tools needed to execute some functions on Icy from a Matlab application. The&nbsp;<a href=\"http://icy.bioimageanalysis.org/plugin/matlab-communicator/Matlab%20X%20server\">Matlab X server</a>&nbsp;plugin, which turns Icy into an image/video/sequence viewer for Matlab, is a typical example of what can be done with Matlab communicator.</p>\n\n<p>(last activity Feb 2013)</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This plugin provides low-level tools needed to execute some functions on Icy from a Matlab application. The&nbsp;<a href=\"http://icy.bioimageanalysis.org/plugin/matlab-communicator/Matlab%20X%20server\">Matlab X server</a>&nbsp;plugin, which turns Icy into an image/video/sequence viewer for Matlab, is a typical example of what can be done with Matlab communicator.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(last activity Feb 2013)</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-16T15:22:48+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:46+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505208480,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Yoann Le Montagner"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":98,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"2ae7ecac-ed23-4375-8a06-79f6a294e65b","url":"/user/98"}],"has_function":[],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d6-45a8-ac32-b321e9bd18f2","url":"/taxonomy/term/4340"}],"has_interaction_level":[{"target_id":3574,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"a22a3a50-0fbb-41ee-944a-38e0b86ac077","url":"/taxonomy/term/3574"}],"has_license"